id: teamwork-tactics-mark
name: Teamwork Tactics
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: what Analytic Fighter's Teamwork Tactics leaves on the one Analyzed - the clock and the bonus the Analyst's,
# read against them (chat.mjs analyticParts, criticalTactics).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Teamwork Tactics: the Analyst's Allies' Combat Rolls against you higher by a quarter of their Scholarship Modifier, till the end of the Analyst's next turn.
text: >
  Teamwork Tactics: If you use the Analysis Maneuver, increase the Combat Rolls of all Allies against that Opponent by 1/4 (rounded up) of your Scholarship Modifier (this effect cannot stack – if multiple Characters use this effect, only gain the highest bonus) until the end of your next turn.

---
